            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Eliza is a practice nurse working in a large general practice in England. She is a trained nurse with additional qualifications in chronic disease management, and is also a registered prescriber. This means she can initiate or repeat medical prescriptions. Today Eliza is reviewing her asthma patients.</AbstractText>
